---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-black text-brand-gray py-12 border-t border-white/10 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-display text-2xl text-brand-yellow mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Pizzetos Pizza</h4>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
        La pizza de tu vida. Ingredientes frescos y el sabor tradicional que nos caracteriza.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase text-sm tracking-wider">Explorar</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="#menu" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Menú Completo</a></li>
        <li><a href="#paquetes" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Paquetes</a></li>
        <li><a href="#sucursales" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Sucursales</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4 uppercase text-sm tracking-wider">Síguenos</h4>
      <div class="flex space-x-4 mb-6">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/PizzetosPizzaMiraflores" target="_blank" class="text-white hover:text-brand-yellow text-xl transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-gray/50">
        © {currentYear} Pizzetos. <br>
        Desarrollado por <a href="https://ollintem.com.mx" class="text-brand-yellow font-bold hover:underline">Ollintem</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>